{"w":2400,"h":3395,"lines":[{"y":0.10747938766851484,"w":0.055555553436279326,"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"t":"Test 1","x":0.20987654416663398},{"t":"READING","w":0.11556719462076814,"c":1,"x":0.51629047665854599,"y":0.14900165449723735,"h":0.015950179352777094},{"x":0.20987654436286335,"y":0.20053003549862203,"w":0.26954732259114583,"h":0.017493220465202852,"c":1,"t":"READING PASSAGE 1"},{"w":0.71226903279622389,"y":0.23170399696595223,"c":1,"t":"You should spend about 20 minutes on Questions 1-13, which are based on Reading","x":0.20970568417714475,"h":0.021196855111453416},{"x":0.2076754085629508,"y":0.24762381391459787,"t":"Passage 1 below.","h":0.017470531104169851,"w":0.14844509124755861,"c":1},{"w":0.6175024922688801,"t":"THE IMPORTANCE OF CHILDREN'S PLAY","x":0.26532592972671193,"y":0.28482240278345305,"h":0.022443598375443963,"c":1},{"t":"Brick by brick, six-year-old Alice is building a magical kingdom. Imagining fairy-tale turrets and","x":0.20560439543908302,"y":0.32072511230618095,"w":0.69577153523763025,"h":0.021271172064072363,"c":1},{"y":0.33727972125354744,"t":"fire-breathing dragons, wicked witches and gallant heroes, she's creating an enchanting world.","h":0.019399065572606067,"c":1,"x":0.20765674889806027,"w":0.66902465820312496},{"t":"Although she isn't aware of it, this fantasy is helping her take her first steps towards her capacity for","y":0.35149244958673176,"w":0.71217681884765627,"h":0.020784481394557686,"c":1,"x":0.20769790085759876},{"y":0.3677677246254234,"x":0.20766649978579835,"t":"creativity and so it will have important repercussions in her adult life.","w":0.49826532999674478,"c":1,"h":0.018943363140272451},{"x":0.20564040331473468,"w":0.67718714396158852,"c":1,"y":0.39936571987939606,"t":"Minutes later, Alice has abandoned the kingdom in favour of playing schools with her younger","h":0.019120889221119541},{"x":0.20769780874194302,"y":0.41475155054322577,"h":0.018504842010066747,"c":1,"w":0.70804143269856767,"t":"brother. When she bosses him around as his 'teacher', she's practising how to regulate her emotions"},{"w":0.7060869344075521,"h":0.019829577074174543,"y":0.42861883754138064,"x":0.20767244866182391,"t":"through pretence. Later on, when they tire of this and settle down with a board game, she's learning","c":1},{"y":0.44421953132342873,"t":"about the need to follow rules and take turns with a partner.","w":0.42218531290690109,"h":0.017084763103435652,"c":1,"x":0.20766040531456742},{"c":1,"x":0.20567414081743371,"h":0.017954472518220022,"y":0.47648504053275842,"t":"'Play in all its rich variety is one of the highest achievements of the human species,' says","w":0.66065221150716136},{"x":0.20564748643999886,"y":0.49132268883729702,"t":"Dr David Whitebread from the Faculty of Education at the University of Cambridge, UK. 'It","w":0.68951237996419268,"h":0.019208407093133428,"c":1},{"w":0.72037714640299477,"h":0.018580495117690776,"y":0.50695345227539723,"x":0.20770988148330824,"t":"underpins how we develop as intellectual, problem-solving adults and is crucial to our success as","c":1},{"y":0.52172086045149302,"w":0.20822725931803385,"c":1,"h":0.017343156048490571,"t":"a highly adaptable species.'","x":0.20352058493619599},{"t":"Recognising the importance of play is not new: over two millennia ago, the Greek philosopher","y":0.55309837060243039,"c":1,"h":0.017619758107215722,"w":0.70186101277669266,"x":0.20769473625399087},{"t":"Plato extolled its virtues as a means of developing skills for adult life, and ideas about play-based","x":0.20561315234002506,"w":0.72454055786132809,"h":0.019493498425882438,"c":1,"y":0.56827128384288317},{"c":1,"w":0.39944048563639323,"x":0.20562911187337463,"h":0.016539879204668151,"t":"learning have been developing since the 19th century.","y":0.58406900786430815},{"c":1,"t":"But we live in changing times, and Whitebread is mindful of a worldwide decline in play, pointing","x":0.20563656062596133,"y":0.61452845306178727,"h":0.018839451393334095,"w":0.73069493611653635},{"x":0.20565062273845627,"y":0.62856018306979178,"w":0.73067743937174479,"c":1,"h":0.018759136626801953,"t":"out that over half the people in the world now live in cities. 'The opportunities for free play, which"},{"h":0.016036308275094724,"t":"I experienced almost every day of my childhood, are becoming increasingly scarce,' he says.","x":0.20370370892773376,"y":0.64680232543508032,"w":0.68724278767903635,"c":1},{"y":0.66123998794527761,"t":"Outdoor play is curtailed by perceptions of risk to do with traffic, as well as parents' increased","x":0.20568752667908902,"w":0.69971923828125004,"h":0.018096873280016301,"c":1},{"w":0.71616485595703117,"h":0.016186205321402913,"c":1,"x":0.20570173381237974,"t":"wish to protect their children from being the victims of crime, and by the emphasis on 'earlier is","y":0.67683359560991119},{"w":0.60108388264973955,"y":0.69161335108812561,"h":0.018331577134778287,"c":1,"t":"better' which is leading to greater competition in academic learning and schools.","x":0.20357136174731313},{"h":0.01689389569178068,"y":0.7220468497792375,"w":0.68334849039713541,"c":1,"t":"International bodies like the United Nations and the European Union have begun to develop","x":0.20359954364919075},{"c":1,"y":0.73725169783321431,"t":"policies concerned with children's right to play, and to consider implications for leisure facilities","w":0.71835998535156242,"h":0.019527325220186631,"x":0.20357806080436422},{"c":1,"x":0.20363452091431347,"w":0.67092132568359375,"t":"and educational programmes. But what they often lack is the evidence to base policies on.","y":0.75412661630603006,"h":0.01770907830012558},{"h":0.018223707470933159,"x":0.20153546610756062,"y":0.78376993869125866,"w":0.71212178548177074,"c":1,"t":"ạiThe type of play we are interested in is child-initiated, spontaneous and unpredictable - but, as"},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"w":0.69958847045898442,"t":"soon as you ask a five-year-old &to playh, then you as the researcher have intervened,' explains","x":0.20370370690069062,"y":0.80087209288482608,"c":1},{"t":"Dr Sara Baker. 'And we want to know what the long-term impact of play is. It's a real challenge.'","w":0.71618642171223956,"h":0.017158182546303302,"c":1,"x":0.20567569111197637,"y":0.81433145832015674},{"t":"16","c":1,"h":0.011627907185728592,"y":0.86482558123800246,"x":0.20164609064749234,"w":0.024691357612609849}]}